cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this repository helps your work, please cite the software release."
title: "DiffusionAccel"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "DiffusionAccel contributors"
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A model-specific hardware exploration stack for masked diffusion language
  models, including exact candidate caching, trace-driven memory analysis,
  native kernels, bit-accurate references, and streaming SystemVerilog.
keywords:
  - diffusion language model
  - FPGA
  - hardware accelerator
  - masked diffusion
  - SystemVerilog
